# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# reference/ is a LOCAL working area. Nothing in it is redistributable:
# WeCreat's own .lbdev files, firmware, and anything extracted from MakeIt!.
# Keep the scripts and the README, ignore everything they produce.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
reference/*
!reference/README.md
!reference/.gitkeep

# Extracted / downloaded vendor material, wherever it lands
**/vendor-lbdev/
**/makeit-extract/
*.lbdev.vendor
*.asar
*.jsc
*.enc
*.tar.gz
*.cor
markcfg*
BslCAD.cfg
LmcPar.cfg

# LightBurn user files that are not ours to publish.
# prefs.ini and User Bundles carry the contributor's whole LightBurn configuration -
# every device, path and preference. We extract key names from them; we never publish them.
prefs.ini
*prefs*.ini
*.lbprefs
*.lbset
*.lbzip
captures/lightburn-prefs-*

# Contributor captures land in captures/ and ARE tracked, but not raw dumps
#
# Filesystem dumps pulled off a controller are NEVER committed. They contain
# device serial numbers, MAC addresses and other per-unit identifiers. Curate the
# findings into a .md capture record instead, and leave the raw dump local.
captures/fileserver-*/
captures/**/*sn.json
captures/**/*mac*
captures/_runlog-*.txt
captures/**/*.pcap
captures/**/*.pcapng
captures/**/*.jpg
captures/**/*.png
!captures/templates/**

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build / scratch
tmp/
temp/
scratch/
*.log
_commitmsg.txt
captures/TEST-*.lbdev

# Raw video is too large for git. Keep the analysed stills instead.
docs/images/*.mp4
